# Grouping & OpenSpec

## Roles

| Artefact | Role |
|----------|------|
| `docs/grouping/olympic-grouping-rules.csv` | OLY runtime rules (first-match; specific before wildcards) |
| `docs/grouping/para-grouping-rules.csv` | PARA runtime rules |
| `docs/grouping/README.md` | Sources + how to upload CSV |
| `openspec/specs/schedule-grouping/spec.md` | Greenfield BE contract (`groups[]` + `groupId`) |
| `openspec/changes/**` | Proposals / deltas — not the live runtime CSV |

## Contract reminders

- Public schedule: units may carry `groupId`; sibling `groups[]` describes each group
- `groups[].id` MUST equal member `units[].groupId`
- Config changeable via CSV upload — no redeploy
- No CSV row for a discipline → typically **no** `groupId` (unless pack says otherwise)

## Editing discipline

- Prefer updating CSV + OpenSpec together when behaviour changes
- Keep Confluence links in README as provenance; do not invent rule rows without a source
- Paris matrix / change proposals live under `openspec/changes/` — promote into CSV/spec deliberately
